{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_4001_007ior", "source_sha256": "43048954fbacdb7288daaa4bcce389e4ec8cbdb57d023614a78b6c60478e95b4", "ja": "……はーいっ、お疲れ様でした！\nふぅ……やっと、一息つけるわね。", "zh": "……好～辛苦了！\n呼……总算能休息一会了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_4002_p", "source_sha256": "1c702aec21972cb95feefcb510c84aabcb9ad1ceaa6a9d1b9d8eabb080532f2b", "ja": "伊織、お疲れ様！　\nこの後は、しばらく自由時間だぞ。", "zh": "伊织，辛苦了！\n之后有一段自由时间喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_4003_p", "source_sha256": "2027540fcdf50d9a08320157d7191d50826c5389114f5d31b6bcefadb595d423", "ja": "どうだ？　せっかく遊園地に来たんだし、\n気分転換に、アトラクションにでも乗ってみるか？", "zh": "如何？难得来一趟游乐园，\n要不要去搭个游乐设施，当作转换心情呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_4004_007ior", "source_sha256": "49c233f7112b430c7f2359f19288dc8915e26ed4709a092a4c96de4f0141f035", "ja": "あら、気の利いた提案ね！\nアンタもなかなかやるじゃない♪", "zh": "哎呀，真是机灵的提议呢！\n你也挺能干的嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_4005_007ior", "source_sha256": "2155d18feeb2fa3aa035146a28028046e08fe1226923214096b693bbaa3c5f18", "ja": "それじゃ、ご褒美として特別に……。\nアンタも、この伊織ちゃんと一緒に乗っていいわよ？", "zh": "那么，作为奖励就特别……\n允许你也和我伊织一起搭吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_4006_007ior", "source_sha256": "b1fb4e5ea5084e113ec5a72e64af71766652001af4b24b7d84bc75204e4fa6ea", "ja": "それで、何に乗るの？\nせっかくだから、アンタが選びなさい♪", "zh": "那么，要去搭什么？\n难得有这个机会，就让你来选吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_4007_p", "source_sha256": "f2b5ad259634056cbdcce722f44841ec0f813fa4a3b09b8a819bf97a2c6ea8d9", "ja": "伊織と一緒に乗るアトラクションか。それじゃ……。", "zh": "和伊织一起搭游乐设施啊，那就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_4008", "source_sha256": "0e9e4d94900bdda109b6a3ecda3ef99149f1bdf8cbe57906041b238dc5c0c27e", "ja": "観覧車", "zh": "摩天轮", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_4009", "source_sha256": "4df3c6d0641e8c151bf6807edfc3b00d8b60491e5d1cc2e9dc07d31b1575ebc9", "ja": "メリーゴーランド", "zh": "旋转木马", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_4010", "source_sha256": "d0a2b1dfd4c7ef11d1f59617f28e5ca3c83bd14d6b5368c6d52a929c5f52c04b", "ja": "お化け屋敷", "zh": "鬼屋", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_4100_p", "source_sha256": "f6feed9ee9275408b15d04dec5b71adceb2cf50b80bf39689ec724f32e52e994", "ja": "観覧車に乗ろうか。園内が見渡せるから、\nきっと、午後のレポートの参考にもなるぞ。", "zh": "去搭摩天轮吧，可以看到园内的全景，\n一定也能作为下午报导时的参考喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_4101_007ior", "source_sha256": "962c497590e13b5a6cb76364a401f6fa7f0c1c30bbeefa5e5198d30d90d42b94", "ja": "……アンタ、今日はすっごく頼りになるじゃない。\nそうね、観覧車にしましょ。", "zh": "……你今天倒是非常可靠嘛。\n也好，就去搭摩天轮吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_4102_007ior", "source_sha256": "51e01a19bd7603da82c3d163fbcb529bdb031dbf48bede594dcbce5fb86fbe1c", "ja": "この伊織ちゃんとふたりっきりで観覧車なんて\nありがたく思いなさいよね？　にひひっ♪", "zh": "居然能和我伊织两人单独搭摩天轮，\n你可要心怀感激喔，咿嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_4200_p", "source_sha256": "a3980ab81e496afbff0af2e654f6e0c94eada385acd266545621f247d23bc61c", "ja": "メリーゴーランドなんて、どうかな。\n伊織、さっき乗りたそうにしてたし。", "zh": "去坐旋转木马你觉得如何？\n而且伊织刚才也看起来很想坐的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_4201_007ior", "source_sha256": "65ca89dc73e3cf456a6eabb2979b3176e74f22f3458bb94d3891635698408155", "ja": "し、してないわよっ！　ふん、メリーゴーランドなんて\n小さな子の乗り物じゃない……。", "zh": "我、我才没有啦！哼，旋转木马那种东西，\n是小孩子在坐的吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_4202_007ior", "source_sha256": "66b86a0f1b4408811a58157c88cfbc4826669edd782a961fcf0549a73c9b5d2d", "ja": "で、でも……アンタがどーしても乗りたいって\nいうんなら、付き合ってあげてもいいわ。", "zh": "不、不过……你如果说什么都想坐的话，\n那要我陪你坐也是可以啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_4203_007ior", "source_sha256": "8960719b71da27287214fbc11bf284c5faaa8efb33cc128e3d87cd6395ee6129", "ja": "ほら、早く行きましょっ！\nまったく大人のくせに、子供みたいなんだからっ。", "zh": "好了，快点走吧！\n真是的，都是个成年人了，却还像个小孩子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_4300_p", "source_sha256": "038914af7590aa01d092be399875335429d43b4723538b206cea2d010db223dc", "ja": "あのお化け屋敷に入ろう。世界一長くて怖いって\n評判らしいから、休憩時間中ずっと楽しめるぞ？", "zh": "进去那个鬼屋吧。听说是全世界路程最长\n又最可怕的鬼屋，可以在休息时间好好享受喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_4301_007ior", "source_sha256": "b1d5ab27648cbc69d96576936574749f2108f0d6c3a1d25ef8bda5642e27fb24", "ja": "べ、別にいいけど……。仕事の休憩中に入るところじゃ\nないし、そもそも乗り物じゃないわよ？", "zh": "我、我是无所谓……但这又不是会在工作休息时\n进去的地方，再说这也不是搭乘的设施吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_4302_007ior", "source_sha256": "e6c8dca4942c7730fc814e70b680f56f278042cc6e162c168b8c1b5eb600b021", "ja": "あ！　まさかアンタ、暗い所に私を連れ込みたい\nだけとか……？　この、変態っ！", "zh": "啊！你该不会只是想把我带到暗处吧……？\n你这变态！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
